  "title": "Cranberry, Cheddar, and Brussels Sprouts Salad",
  "description": "This combo of crunchy Brussels sprouts, aged Cheddar, dried cranberries, and a sweet, creamy ginger and Dijon dressing is perfect for your holiday meal or for lunch, any day!",
